# Phantasy Cloud (optional) — copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# Both values come from your Supabase project: Settings → API.
# The anon key is a public, browser-safe key; row-level security policies on
# ps_cloud_saves / ps_players are what protect player data. Never put the
# service_role key here — it bypasses RLS and would be shipped to every player.
#
# Leave these unset and the game still builds and runs; the Phantasy Cloud
# menu simply reports that the service is unavailable.
#
# See docs/phantasy-cloud.md for the one-time Supabase setup (email template,
# SMTP, and the SQL schema).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
